{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0296_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_intro_1000_null", "source_sha256": "b775df638295e6968ac8808373fb504107f690dc22a3cfe9a16dd939c63faecc", "ja": "―これは少女たちが夢の扉を見つける、\n少し前の物語（ルビ：エピソード）―", "zh": "——这是少女们在寻获梦想之门前，\n稍早一些的故事——", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0296_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_intro_1001_001har", "source_sha256": "198600359a4d526fdf8faedb03f3126c6cce430d7a7c239cb59512fb5d883f25", "ja": "それじゃ……、行ってきますね、", "zh": "那么……我出发了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0296_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_intro_1002_001har", "source_sha256": "45fef467b409344c15f0fc57e75934f692b09e657641fe0c1eb9dfa22edeb5c6", "ja": "プロデューサーさん！", "zh": "制作人！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0296_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_intro_1003_036kan", "source_sha256": "45fef467b409344c15f0fc57e75934f692b09e657641fe0c1eb9dfa22edeb5c6", "ja": "プロデューサーさん！", "zh": "制作人！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0296_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_intro_1004_402cpr", "source_sha256": "36715a0db82dfed3cebfb77240a999689b9a75e47453710dab9c549718e0684c", "ja": "ああ！", "zh": "嗯嗯！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0296_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_intro_1005_401pro", "source_sha256": "a8fd86d23e2ad8a21912cf51de4a6ff256c07739ed98f9c7e0cd3ef55152f106", "ja": "うん！", "zh": "嗯！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0296_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_intro_1006_se", "source_sha256": "1bc3a8409472ad9a9f748008273063c2e66bdb2fc0aeef0f96e61e4c779e8348", "ja": "（ワアアアァァァァァ……！）", "zh": "（哇啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0296_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_intro_1007_null", "source_sha256": "d4bd80df41043c25dd01b8f6c73fd1f2a8b813e119559e9027a8882e9729c250", "ja": "◆ミリシタ用　アニメ「ミリオンライブ」\n連動コンテンツ用ロゴ表示", "zh": "◆剧场时光用 动画《百万现场》\n联动内容用Logo显示", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0296_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_intro_1008_101kot", "source_sha256": "a455084fd014e58d652cba49f76e0ec88d826d33bd6ba892f7433362e6ddcbf3", "ja": "みなさーん。そろそろ朝礼を始めますから、\n集まってくださいね～。", "zh": "各位——差不多要开始晨会了，\n请大家集合哦～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0296_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_intro_1009_401pro", "source_sha256": "2390cff512a763a5091f7b5bf7c3fd3940133a4633d1587d7f127f88072d2003", "ja": "はいっ！　先輩、朝礼だそうでーす！", "zh": "是！前辈，说是要开早会啦——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0296_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_intro_1010_null", "source_sha256": "aab6bed88e8e1e384dce193d27907cb10db043e2d4ed9c456b5bfe95acd86b6b", "ja": "//テロップ風ブック表示『プロデューサー』", "zh": "//字幕式书本显示『制作人』", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0296_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_intro_1011_402cpr", "source_sha256": "aa6d24a69da9edcc3ee7ccd41cd49d53f77ecf9d4f500442fdec7ce4c789bdc4", "ja": "そんな大声出さなくても聞こえてるって。\nここ狭いんだから……っと、おはようございます！", "zh": "不用喊那么大声，我听得见啦。这里很窄的……啊，早上好！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0296_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_intro_1012_null", "source_sha256": "da6031052de61385e0b81dfa2c12f1d03669dcf76940f8801aa3f2cb87e08ec5", "ja": "//テロップ風ブック表示『チ―フプロデューサー』", "zh": "//字幕风格书本显示『首席制作人』", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0296_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_intro_1013_president", "source_sha256": "0a2bec748fbf829e836e9f7be14f8beeaf5ee28946f0aa9bb32f44ae4d60daf8", "ja": "うむ、おはよう諸君。\n今日も元気が良くて何よりだ。はっはっは！", "zh": "嗯，各位早上好。\n今天也这么有精神，真是再好不过了。哈哈大笑！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0296_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_intro_1014_president", "source_sha256": "dec3654d642d1276b7dc5557db2be6f44f5dd8f0cf360695775788a9d983cea4", "ja": "ところで、765プロオールスターズのライブツアー、\nかなり好調じゃないか！", "zh": "对了，765PRO ALL STARS的巡演，进行得相当顺利嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0296_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_intro_1015_402cpr", "source_sha256": "5a5d8245d9870939d2cfb06331829b1fd2ceec84698f2c1983eb6643bcfa9417", "ja": "はい、期待を大きく上回る反響です。\n物販系ももう追加の手配が必要で。", "zh": "是的，反响远远超出了预期。连周边商品也已经需要追加订购了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0296_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_intro_1016_president", "source_sha256": "40647c2e7270e2a9de6037944a6525943fb53e0b9113e03fe602b755a5259d95", "ja": "それはすばらしい！　音無君、善は急げだ。\n物販追加の手配、頼まれてくれるかね？", "zh": "太棒了！音无，事不宜迟。  \n能拜托你安排追加周边销售吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0296_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_intro_1017_101kot", "source_sha256": "608070f5db75f592213a90887303a8cff8f2508ceb16d7bd14721e67762b32c3", "ja": "はい社長！　では私の方で見積りを出して、\nチーフに確認してもらいますね。", "zh": "好的，社长！那我这边先做份报价，再请组长确认一下。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0296_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_intro_1018_402cpr", "source_sha256": "510682f665821d871b4ad2a1813bde7319cd5cd2dbe99f6da16318d2fed3cf1b", "ja": "助かります。それと……社長、次のアリーナライブ\nには、こいつも連れていっていいですか？", "zh": "帮大忙了。另外……社长，下次的体育馆演唱会，可以也带这家伙一起去吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0296_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_intro_1019_401pro", "source_sha256": "698bceb8b2cde22b3e18c7997b79111a01188443db7d58daa8772fe9dfeca06c", "ja": "え？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0296_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_intro_1020_president", "source_sha256": "2c5496241936bbb3ac2801495c11b339f97029f95cfe9d718c9d10448d91051a", "ja": "そうだね、そろそろ頃合いだろう。\n君、よろしく頼むよ！", "zh": "是啊，差不多到时候了。就拜托你了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0296_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_intro_1021_401pro", "source_sha256": "0ae19ab60b03f5ab47e813d4905c6e9d9f02634197c8bbb6ead7a4a076bd0873", "ja": "……はいっ、ありがとうございます！\n先輩、俺、雑用でもなんでも全力でやりますから！", "zh": "……好的，非常感谢您！\n前辈，杂活什么的无论什么我都会全力以赴去做的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0296_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_intro_1022_402cpr", "source_sha256": "42973d91635b6f70bb42d8fc1ddf2fc65bb080e26b7ac4546a00a3d33e911018", "ja": "雑用じゃないよ。じつは次のライブ、新人の子たちに\nダンサーをやってもらおうと思ってる。", "zh": "不是杂事。其实我想让新人们在下一场演唱会上担任舞者。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0296_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_intro_1023_401pro", "source_sha256": "97cca317f64feee0b90985693138800434e6dfdbc17f7f26232b9eec1174e793", "ja": "え？　……ええっ！？\nでもまだ全然、レッスン中ですよね？", "zh": "诶？……诶诶！？\n可是她们现在还在练习中吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0296_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_intro_1024_402cpr", "source_sha256": "8f52353a7273f8b399284d2af65c9b93a147e1712f4b644be8c709f75c5c36f3", "ja": "経験は最高のレッスンになるぞ。……というか、ツアー\nの刺激として、ライブ構成に大きな変化が欲しいんだ。", "zh": "经验就是最棒的课程。……不如说，我想给这次巡演增加点刺激，让演唱会的编排有很大的变化。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0296_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_intro_1025_402cpr", "source_sha256": "2e0bd41f6a5e4518076c71cef93982307e10ac30319e15b95ecf03e89aee718f", "ja": "プロのダンサーとも違う、新人アイドルならではの\n魅力を使わせてもらおうかな、と。", "zh": "和职业舞者不同，我想不如利用一下新人偶像独有的魅力吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0296_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_intro_1026_401pro", "source_sha256": "fec2cfbdc7dd2ffafe770bf44915021018bd6054c8c8a6f22c9bfe4b7e6914ca", "ja": "なるほど……！", "zh": "原来如此……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0296_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_intro_1027_402cpr", "source_sha256": "c589fcd5fe22e188209d9a159d81bdcb8204729a7266f75ef647a6bb062fe198", "ja": "お前には新人の担当として、一緒に来てもらいたい\nんだ。新プロジェクトの準備の意味でもな。", "zh": "我想让你作为新人的负责人，和我一起去。也是为了准备新项目。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0296_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_intro_1028_101kot", "source_sha256": "9ea4139cc06c09c4bfa1c49eecef79a9724a5eb6c817c62c5c2dbdfbec911109", "ja": "新プロジェクト……。\n『765プロライブシアタープロジェクト』ですね♪", "zh": "新项目……也就是“765职业现场剧场项目”吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0296_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_intro_1029_president", "source_sha256": "def4be36ac1eb512d149c86b199e324bb0bf2117d66f8b72564810c8c4428538", "ja": "ライブシアタープロジェクトの準備は着々と進んでいる\nよ。土地の取得に設計図面、そして求人広告……。", "zh": "Live剧场项目的准备工作正稳步推进哦。土地购置、设计图纸，还有招聘广告……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0296_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_intro_1030_president", "source_sha256": "4332fc285911de383006127656fa23e2e418b602fd485dcfd7181d4aaa8f2285", "ja": "そうそう、アイドルもまだまだ募集していいからね！\nどんどんオーディションしてくれたまえ！", "zh": "对了，偶像还可以继续招募哦！\n尽管放手去进行更多甄选吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0296_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_intro_1031_401pro", "source_sha256": "3d5635f8c3004b0a4799c54ccf5d820c39effb9a61d8b22ac25ac0d2a9bffadd", "ja": "は、はい……そうですよね。専用の劇場で毎日公演を\nするとなると、まだまだ足りない……。", "zh": "是、是的……您说得对。要在专属剧场里每天举行公演，偶像的人数还远远不够……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0296_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_intro_1032_402cpr", "source_sha256": "ced93e5dd57139a838d31bc022765a41e215b9b4f174440faab1c9bb290bba4c", "ja": "ひとまずは、今いる子たちだ。ダンサーアイドルとして\nしっかりプロデュースしてやってくれ。", "zh": "总之，先从现在在这里的孩子们开始吧。请好好培养她们，让她们成为舞者偶像。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0296_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_intro_1033_401pro", "source_sha256": "000c5b81f82fdc76a36a084434943aaead2dd16b99a43a19f07bc85e81e33e45", "ja": "あ、はいっ！　……そっか。\n俺、本当にプロデューサーになるんだ……！", "zh": "啊，好！……这样啊。\n我真的要成为制作人了……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0296_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_intro_1034_101kot", "source_sha256": "b29902c13dc590def52dba7fa5061a97e9d882d3f1f9f9acd90fc8a39d530a04", "ja": "ふふっ、よかったですね、プロデューサーさん♪", "zh": "呵呵，太好了，制作人♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0296_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_intro_1035_401pro", "source_sha256": "cc60f5b86967ccb3bf6dfd5368361a3b6d31c3130f84928b6d903852e5b2d1e6", "ja": "……ありがとうございます。頑張ります！", "zh": "……谢谢您。我会努力的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0296_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_intro_1036_president", "source_sha256": "37221adf7e17104137b651108e0ab97f68d7518ca740eaca9a553763df0b4926", "ja": "君たちが作り出す、今度のステージ。それは必ず、\n765プロを新たな未来に導いてくれるだろう。", "zh": "你们所打造的下一场舞台。那一定能\n引领765事务所走向崭新的未来吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0296_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_intro_1037_president", "source_sha256": "c85fb94d75420e046307778d025859e1c62d512112ed32d22510d19b77dd1c47", "ja": "いや、じつに楽しみだ！　全員一丸となって、\nひとつ、よろしく頼むよ～！", "zh": "不，真是令人期待啊！全员团结一心，  \n这次就拜托大家啦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0296_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_intro_1038_402cpr", "source_sha256": "033f7be18e9b9ff324ace80a37fa8967638f1712dc09a7bd36147111ac821d43", "ja": "よろしくお願いします！", "zh": "请多多指教！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0296_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_intro_1039_401pro", "source_sha256": "033f7be18e9b9ff324ace80a37fa8967638f1712dc09a7bd36147111ac821d43", "ja": "よろしくお願いします！", "zh": "请多多指教！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0296_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_intro_1040_101kot", "source_sha256": "bdf83c0c2543de8d5daa90ad1fbf03a683ebe7f043031b69b912d676e46aea17", "ja": "よろしくお願いします♪", "zh": "请多多指教♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
